# Reopen the prior run's acknowledged profile copy with the origin and resident gone.
settle 5
key escape
omnibar actions
type Switch to session R3 Oversize Three
key enter
settle 8
act Search saved sources
type oversize saved marker
wait-saved-sources 600
assert suggestions == 1
key enter
wait-saved-reader 1200
assert snap saved-reader-state == Ready
assert snap saved-reader-quote == oversize saved marker
capture 01_large_saved_text_without_resident
record-saved-sources 01_large_saved_text_without_resident
act Save session
log Large saved text displayed completely without origin or resident
